---

<Layout
  title="Careers | Cliffco Mortgage Bankers"
  description="Join Cliffco Mortgage Bankers - a collaborative, growth-focused team of loan officers and mortgage professionals. View open positions and apply today."
>
  <Breadcrumbs trail={[
    { name: "Home", href: "/" },
    { name: "Careers", href: "/careers/" },
  ]} />

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="container-wide pt-14 pb-16">
    <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 items-center">
      <div>
        <h1 class="mt-3" style="font-size: var(--text-display-lg);">
          Join a team that gets<br class="hidden sm:block"/> people home.
        </h1>
        <p class="lead mt-6">
          At Cliffco, we surround ourselves with people who have an appetite for success. Loan officers
          here don't compete against each other - they share blueprints, lift each other up, and win
          together. If that sounds like your kind of team, keep reading.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex gap-3 flex-wrap">
          <a href="#loan-officers" class="btn btn-primary">For Loan Officers</a>
          <a href="#corporate" class="btn btn-secondary">For Corporate Roles</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hidden lg:block rounded-2xl overflow-hidden aspect-[4/3]">
        <img
          src="/images/content%20images/Careers.jpg"
          alt="Cliffco team"
          class="w-full h-full object-cover"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- THE CLIFFCO DIFFERENCE -->
  <section class="bg-[var(--color-mist-gray)] section">
    <div class="container-wide">
      <h2 class="mt-3" style="font-size: var(--text-h2);">A different kind of culture.</h2>
      <p class="lead mt-4 max-w-2xl text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">
        Our operations team and leadership are laser-focused on collaboration and transparency.
        We're changemakers - people who provide real solutions and use technology to stay ahead
        of the market.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-accent)]/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[var(--color-accent)]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)]">Collaborative by design</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">
            Loan officers share strategies, not just leads. Leadership is accessible. The people
            at the top built their books the same way you will.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-accent)]/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[var(--color-accent)]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)]">Built for producers</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">
            Marketing, technology, training, and a full product stack - everything a high-producing
            LO needs is already here. You focus on relationships; we handle the rest.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-accent)]/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[var(--color-accent)]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)]">Real growth, real results</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">
            We celebrate wins - individually and as a team. Your growth is the whole point.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- VALUES -->
  <section class="section bg-white">
    <div class="container-wide">
      <h2 class="mt-3" style="font-size: var(--text-h2);">What we stand for.</h2>
      <div class="mt-10 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5">
        {values.map((v) => (
          <div class="border border-[var(--color-mist-gray)] rounded-xl p-5 hover:border-[var(--color-accent)] transition-colors">
            <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-accent)]/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[var(--color-accent)]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" viewBox="0 0 24 24" set:html={v.icon} />
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[var(--color-accent)]">{v.name}</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[var(--color-text-muted)] leading-relaxed">{v.desc}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- LO BENEFITS -->
  <section id="loan-officers" class="section bg-[var(--color-mist-gray)]">
    <div class="container-wide">
      <p class="eyebrow">For loan officers</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3" style="font-size: var(--text-h2);">Everything you need to produce.</h2>
      <p class="lead mt-4 max-w-2xl text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">
        Whether you're a seasoned LO looking for a better platform or a branch manager ready to
        bring your team, here's what you get on day one.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3">
        {loBenefits.map((b) => (
          <div class="card flex flex-col gap-3">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)]">{b.title}</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-muted)] leading-relaxed flex-1">{b.desc}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>

      <div class="mt-10 bg-[var(--color-rich-black)] text-white rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-10 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center gap-6 justify-between">
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-lg">Loan officer or branch manager?</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-white/70 text-sm">Send your resume and we'll set up a conversation.</p>
        </div>
        <a
          href="mailto:employment@cliffcomortgage.com"
          class="btn btn-primary !bg-white !text-[var(--color-rich-black)] whitespace-nowrap shrink-0"
        >
          Apply Now
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CORPORATE ROLES -->
  <section id="corporate" class="section bg-white">
    <div class="container-wide grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.2fr] items-start">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Corporate and operations</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3" style="font-size: var(--text-h2);">Behind every great LO is a great team.</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[var(--color-text-muted)] leading-relaxed">
          Our operations team is the backbone of Cliffco. From processors and underwriters to
          marketers and compliance professionals - every role matters, and everyone is invested
          in getting borrowers across the finish line.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[var(--color-text-muted)] leading-relaxed">
          If you're interested in a career in mortgage operations, corporate administration,
          or any of the roles below, we'd love to hear from you.
        </p>
        <a
          href="mailto:hr@cliffcomortgage.com"
          class="btn btn-primary mt-6 inline-block"
        >
          Apply Now
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3 lg:pt-16">
        {corporateRoles.map((role) => (
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2 rounded-xl px-4 py-5 text-center bg-[var(--color-accent)]/8 border border-[var(--color-accent)]/20 hover:bg-[var(--color-accent)]/14 hover:border-[var(--color-accent)]/40 transition-colors">
            <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-accent)]/15 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[var(--color-accent)]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" viewBox="0 0 24 24" set:html={role.icon} />
            </div>
            <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)] leading-tight">{role.name}</span>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="accent-gradient">
    <div class="container-wide py-16 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-white" style="font-size: var(--text-h2);">Ready to join the team?</h2>
      <p class="lead mt-4 text-white/85">
        Two ways in. One culture. Tell us who you are and what you do best.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex justify-center gap-3 flex-wrap">
        <a href="mailto:employment@cliffcomortgage.com" class="btn btn-primary !bg-white !text-[var(--color-rich-black)]">Loan Officers</a>
        <a href="mailto:hr@cliffcomortgage.com" class="btn btn-secondary !border-white !text-white">Corporate Roles</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
